                "title": "Elegant Scroll Door Lever",
                "description": "Graceful in the way the handle gently spirals, this lever gives the illusion of a continuous line from tip to rose, exuding elegance without being gaudy. The Elegant Scroll Door Lever has a circular rose that has concealed screw mounting. It fits most standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparations. The Omnia 55 Scroll Lever with Round Rose is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia 55/00 Lever Latchsets, OMN-55/00, elegant door levers, spiral handle lever latchsets, circular rose door levers, omnia ornate door levers, Scroll Levers, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, Classic Door Levers, ada compliant levers, omnia traditions collection"
